ision.","roleCommunityEngagementProfessionalLabel":"Community engagement professional","roleCommunityEngagementProfessionalGuidance":"Clarify who can influence the work and how people will know what happened with their input.","roleAccessibilityOrLanguageAccessProfessionalLabel":"Accessibility or language access professional","roleAccessibilityOrLanguageAccessProfessionalGuidance":"Plan for access early enough to shape the experience, not only the final format.","roleDataResearchOrQualityProfessionalLabel":"Data, research, or quality professional","roleDataResearchOrQualityProfessionalGuidance":"Use evidence to answer a decision question while protecting people and small groups.","roleFiscalProcurementOrContractsProfessionalLabel":"Fiscal, procurement, or contracts professional","roleFiscalProcurementOrContractsProfessionalGuidance":"Consider who can meet the requirements, who carries the burden, and who benefits.","roleCommunicationsProfessionalLabel":"Communications professional","roleCommunicationsProfessionalGuidance":"Help people find, understand, and act on the information in the form they need.","roleEquityDirectorOrSpecialistLabel":"Equity Director or Equity Specialist","roleEquityDirectorOrSpecialistGuidance":"Connect the immediate task to the wider program, responsible partners, and durable follow-through.","roleAnotherRoleLabel":"Another role","roleAnotherRoleGuidance":"Choose the area closest to your next decision. You can adjust your starting point as you learn more.","urgencyExploratoryLabel":"I’m planning ahead","urgencyExploratoryGuidance":"You have room to review sources, involve people early, and shape the work before decisions harden.","urgencyWithin2WeeksLabel":"I need support within two weeks","urgencyWithin2WeeksGuidance":"Begin with the next decision and identify who needs to be involved before the two-week point.","urgencyHardDeadlineLabel":"I have a firm deadline","urgencyHardDeadlineGuidance":"Name the deadline and the decision that must be