 and coaching to practice a more adaptive response"],"stageApplicationLabel":"Applied equity","stageApplicationPurpose":"Bring equity and access into workforce, policy, program, service, engagement, fiscal, and communication decisions early enough to shape them.","stageApplicationOutcomes":["Use practical questions and tools on a current decision","Involve affected people and responsible partners before choices harden","Create a useful work product with owners and a review date"],"stageSystemsPracticeLabel":"Systems and structural practice","stageSystemsPracticePurpose":"Examine patterns, power, burden, disparities, and institutional conditions across more than one decision or team.","stageSystemsPracticeOutcomes":["Move from isolated events to patterns supported by evidence","Identify structures that reproduce barriers or unequal results","Design accountability and learning without surveillance"],"stageLeadershipContinuityLabel":"Leadership and continuity","stageLeadershipContinuityPurpose":"Sustain change through supervision, mentoring, sponsorship, shared governance, repair, resources, and learning over time.","stageLeadershipContinuityOutcomes":["Connect leadership behavior with structural responsibility","Build mentoring, feedback, repair, and development into the work","Create durable ownership, review cycles, and continuity through change"]}},{"surfaceId":"learn.hub","routePattern":"/learn","staffLabel":"Learning and resource themes","scopePolicy":"inheritable","fieldContract":[{"key":"title","label":"title","kind":"long","required":true,"maxLength":1000},{"key":"intro","label":"intro","kind":"long","required":true,"maxLength":1000},{"key":"searchLabel","label":"search Label","kind":"long","required":true,"maxLength":1000},{"key":"searchButton","label":"search Button","kind":"long","required":true,"maxLength":1000},{"key":"themeLabel","label":"theme Label","kind":"long","required":true,"maxLength":1000},{"key":"allLabel","label":"all Label","kind":"long","req