nnected to the","questionExample":"For example: We're planning a new digital application for benefits renewals. What equity questions should we consider before making design decisions?","scopeLabel":"Where should Ask look?","modeAuto":"Start with program resources; check current public sources when helpful","modeProgram":"Use program resources only","modeResults":"Find public sources to read","modeCurrent":"Answer using current public sources","modeDeep":"Take a deeper look at public sources","researchAvailableHelp":"You can ask for a list of public sources to read or an answer based on current public information.","researchUnavailableHelp":"Outside research is not available right now. Ask can still answer from program resources.","questionTooShort":"Please add a few more words about the work or decision you are considering.","answerError":"We couldn't finish that answer just now. Please try again or search the Library.","findSourcesButton":"Find sources","answerButton":"Get an answer","libraryButton":"Search the Library instead","starterQuestionsLabel":"Starter questions for this path","askedKicker":"You asked","oneDhsName":"One DHS","oneDsdName":"One DSD","differentSupportLead":"This question needs a different kind of support.","rightPersonLabel":"Find the right person","previewConsultLabel":"Preview a consultation request","alternativesHeading":"What you can do instead","howKicker":"How answers work","howItems":["Answers begin with the main point, then show the sources, limits, and next steps.","If you choose it, Ask can also look at current public sources.","Public information appears separately from program resources. Check important details at the original source before you act.","Ask can help you think through your work. It does not create official policy or make decisions for you.","You can review or clear your question history from My Work."],"howOneDhsSupport":"When human judgment is needed, Ask points you to the responsible person or office.","howDsdOpenS